<p>
  You're in.
</p>

<p>
  Fuime is ready for you. Click the button to log in — it opens in this
  browser and signs you in with the same email this message was sent to.
</p>

<p>
  <%= link_to "Log in to Fuime", @login_url,
              style: "display:inline-block;background:#2242FF;color:#ffffff;padding:12px 20px;text-decoration:none;border-radius:8px;font-weight:600;" %>
</p>

<p style="word-break: break-all;">
  Or paste this link into your browser:<br>
  <%= link_to @login_url, @login_url %>
</p>

<% if @cohort.present? %>
  <p>
    You're joining <strong><%= @cohort.name %></strong>. When you apply, the
    event code <strong><%= @cohort.code %></strong> will already be on your
    application.
  </p>
<% end %>

<p>
  The link works for 14 days. After that, go to
  <%= link_to @login_page_url, @login_page_url %>
  and we'll email you a login code.
</p>

<p>
  If you did not join the Fuime waitlist, you can ignore this. Nothing
  happens unless you click the link.
</p>

<p>
  Questions? Reply to this email or write to <%= @support_email %>.
</p>

<p>
  — the Fuime team
</p>
